  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Xue Song Zi is a snow path Gu Immortal. Snow path and ice path are nearly indistinguishable and closely related, and this Gu suits him better than wooden chicken Immortal Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          874
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "suitability",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_immortal",
          "path_snow",
          "gu_wooden_chicken_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Qin Bai Sheng also supplies several immortal killer moves that use ice heart Immortal Gu as the core, covering attack, defense, movement, healing, and more. He had promised that if the mission succeeded, Xue Song Zi would keep the Gu as a reward.",
        "chapters": [
          874
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "killer-moves",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_qin_bai_sheng"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Among those moves, ice heart lock can freeze a desolate beast through flesh and bone, at a high immortal essence cost.",
        "chapters": [
          874
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "killer-moves",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
